:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2008/739]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 23 January 2023. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 1 November 2023, so this translation is behind current law.

